@startuml sd_us202
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
title US202 - Sequence Diagram
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
actor "Backoffice Operator" as Actor
participant "Entry (Envoy)\nvirtual IP of aircraft-maintenance" as EAM
box "aircraft-maintenance-n (the replica that answers)" #F7F7F7
participant "AircraftModelController" as AircraftModelController
participant "RegisterAircraftModelUseCase" as RegisterAircraftModelUseCase
participant "UpdateAircraftModelImageUseCase" as UpdateAircraftModelImageUseCase
participant "GetAircraftModelImageUseCase" as GetAircraftModelImageUseCase
database "own database" as DBAM
participant "Outbox dispatcher" as OBAM
end box
collections "peer replicas\naircraft-maintenance-m" as PAM
== POST /api/aircraftModels ==
Actor -> EAM : POST /api/aircraftModels\n(HTTPS, Authorization: Bearer JWT)
EAM -> AircraftModelController : to a ready replica\n(another one if it fails)
AircraftModelController -> RegisterAircraftModelUseCase : execute(...)
RegisterAircraftModelUseCase -> DBAM : model name already in the catalog?
RegisterAircraftModelUseCase -> DBAM : save aircraft model + one copy per other replica in the outbox\n(same transaction)
RegisterAircraftModelUseCase --> AircraftModelController : created
AircraftModelController --> Actor : 201 Created
OBAM -> PAM : PUT /internal/replicas/aircraft-models\n(to every other replica, retried until delivered)
PAM --> OBAM : 200 (applied if newer)
== PATCH /api/aircraftModels/{modelName}/image ==
Actor -> EAM : PATCH /api/aircraftModels/{modelName}/image\n(HTTPS, Authorization: Bearer JWT)
EAM -> AircraftModelController : to a ready replica\n(another one if it fails)
AircraftModelController -> UpdateAircraftModelImageUseCase : execute(...)
UpdateAircraftModelImageUseCase -> DBAM : apply the change to this replica's copy\n+ one copy per other replica in the outbox (same transaction)
UpdateAircraftModelImageUseCase --> AircraftModelController : updated
AircraftModelController --> Actor : 200 OK
OBAM -> PAM : PUT /internal/replicas/aircraft-models\n(to every other replica; the latest change wins)
PAM --> OBAM : 200 (applied if newer)
== GET /api/aircraftModels/{modelName}/image ==
Actor -> EAM : GET /api/aircraftModels/{modelName}/image\n(HTTPS, Authorization: Bearer JWT)
EAM -> AircraftModelController : to a ready replica\n(another one if it fails)
AircraftModelController -> GetAircraftModelImageUseCase : execute(...)
GetAircraftModelImageUseCase -> DBAM : read aircraft models
note right of DBAM : catalog: complete on every replica
DBAM --> GetAircraftModelImageUseCase : data
GetAircraftModelImageUseCase --> AircraftModelController : result
AircraftModelController --> Actor : 200 OK (X-Node-Id)
@enduml
